/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Author (Aswani\040Yaramala\054\040Soheila\040Farokhi\054\040Hamid\040Karimi)
/Title (Navigating\040the\040Data\055Rich\040Landscape\040of\040Online\040Learning\072\040Insights\040and\040Predictions\040from\040ASSISTments)
/Subject (This\040paper\040presents\040an\040in\055depth\040analysis\040of\040student\040behavior\040and\040score\040prediction\040in\040the\040ASSISTments\040online\040learning\040platform\056\040Leveraging\040the\040comprehensive\040dataset\040from\040the\040EDM\040Cup\0402023\040Kaggle\040Competition\054\040we\040address\040four\040research\040questions\040related\040to\040the\040impact\040of\040tutoring\040materials\054\040skill\040mastery\054\040feature\040extraction\054\040and\040graph\040representation\040learning\056\040To\040investigate\040the\040impact\040of\040tutoring\040materials\054\040we\040analyze\040the\040influence\040of\040students\040requesting\040hints\040and\040explanations\040on\040their\040performance\040in\040end\055of\055unit\040assignments\056\040Our\040findings\040provide\040insights\040into\040the\040role\040of\040guidance\040in\040learning\040and\040inform\040the\040development\040of\040superior\040tutoring\040strategies\056\040Additionally\054\040we\040explore\040the\040correlation\040between\040mastery\057non\055mastery\040of\040specific\040skills\040during\040in\055unit\040problems\040and\040performance\040in\040corresponding\040end\055of\055unit\040assignments\054\040shedding\040light\040on\040the\040efficacy\040of\040standard\055aligned\040curricula\056\040In\040terms\040of\040feature\040extraction\054\040we\040extract\040relevant\040features\040from\040extensive\040student\040activity\040data\040and\040determine\040their\040importance\040in\040predicting\040assignment\040grades\056\040This\040enhances\040student\040performance\040prediction\054\040aiding\040the\040early\040identification\040of\040at\055risk\040students\040and\040enabling\040effective\040monitoring\040of\040progress\056\040Furthermore\054\040we\040employ\040graph\040representation\040learning\040techniques\040to\040model\040the\040complex\040relationships\040between\040different\040entities\040in\040the\040dataset\056\040This\040yields\040a\040more\040nuanced\040understanding\040of\040factors\040influencing\040student\040performance\040and\040facilitates\040the\040development\040of\040more\040accurate\040predictive\040models\056\040Overall\054\040our\040study\040contributes\040to\040the\040theoretical\040understanding\040and\040practical\040application\040of\040data\040mining\040techniques\040in\040online\040learning\040contexts\054\040with\040implications\040for\040personalized\040learning\054\040interventions\054\040and\040support\040mechanisms\056\040The\040code\040and\040data\040are\040anonymously\040available\040in\040https\072\057\057anonymous\0564open\056science\057r\057EDM\0552024\055110E\057\056)
>>
